t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-954e33e \" data-id=\"954e33e\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a33b502 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a33b502\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mermaid Beach is one of the Gold Coast\u2019s most sought-after beachside suburbs\u2014and this dual-lot project at 74 Hedges Avenue and 6 Hilda Street was one of our most complex <a href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/services\/demolition\/residential\/\" title=\"Residential demolition services Gold Coast\">residential demolitions<\/a> to date.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Two substantial houses on adjacent corner lots, both requiring full <a href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/services\/asbestos-removal\/residential\/\" title=\"Residential asbestos removal\">asbestos remediation<\/a> before the structures could come down. Both properties sat at different levels with multiple split sections, creating challenging structural conditions that demanded careful planning and execution.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t<\/section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\" elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d016aa2 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d016aa2\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-fc98d94 \" data-id=\"fc98d94\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c35c0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4c35c0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.22.0 - 17-06-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1438\" src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/coastal-demolitions-hedges-avenue-mermaid-beach-demolition-25.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-11197\" alt=\"Aerial photo of 74 Hedges Avenue demolition showing proximity to Mermaid Beach coastline\" srcset=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/coastal-demolitions-hedges-avenue-mermaid-beach-demolition-25.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/coastal-demolitions-hedges-avenue-mermaid-beach-demolition-25-1024x767.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/coastal-demolitions-hedges-avenue-mermaid-beach-demolition-25-768x575.jpg 768w, https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/coastal-demolitions-hedges-avenue-mermaid-beach-demolition-25-1536x1150.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t<\/section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\" elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c741376 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c741376\" data-element_type=\"section\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-34e8a2a \" data-id=\"34e8a2a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e671254 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e671254\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Project Scope & Demolition Process<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a02bc48 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a02bc48\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This project required Coastal Demolitions to manage the complete demolition of two separate dwellings across adjacent lots on a prominent corner in Mermaid Beach\u2014just metres from the beach. The site sat within a high-value residential streetscape surrounded by multi-million dollar homes, meaning every stage of the project had to be planned with precision, safety, and minimal disruption to neighbouring properties.<\/span><\/p><h3>Asbestos Remediation<\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Before any demolition work could begin, both properties underwent full asbestos assessments. As expected for houses of this era on the Gold Coast, asbestos-containing materials were identified throughout\u2014in eaves, wall cladding, wet areas, and roofing materials. Our <a href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/services\/asbestos-removal\/\" title=\"Asbestos removal services\">Class A licensed asbestos removal<\/a> team completed the full asbestos strip under controlled conditions, with all materials safely removed, wrapped, and transported to licensed disposal facilities under our EPA Transport Licence. Air monitoring was conducted throughout to ensure compliance with Workplace Health and Safety Queensland requirements.<\/span><\/p><h3>Structural Demolition<\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With asbestos clearance certificates issued, the structural demolition phase commenced. Both properties presented unique challenges\u2014multiple split levels, different foundation heights between the two lots, and proximity to boundary fences and neighbouring structures. Our crew used a combination of mechanical demolition with our fleet of excavators, systematically working through roof structures, wall framing, and foundations. The houses were pushed over in spectacular fashion\u2014a controlled method that brings the structure down efficiently while keeping the site contained.<\/span><\/p><h3>Site Clearance &#038; Recycling<\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Following demolition, all materials were sorted on-site for recycling. Timber, steel, concrete, and other salvageable materials were separated and directed to appropriate recycling facilities\u2014consistent with our commitment to recycling 85% of all demolition salvage. The sites were cleared of all debris, foundations were removed, and the land was graded clean and level\u2014ready for the next development in this premium beachside location.<\/span><\/p><h3>Why This Project Matters<\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dual-